    p "Section 432, " ["Pub. L. 91–458, title II, § 203" -> "/us/pl/91/458/tII/s203"] ", Oct. 16, 1970, " ["84 Stat. 972" -> "/us/stat/84/972"] "; " ["Pub. L. 96–423, § 3" -> "/us/pl/96/423/s3"] ", Oct. 10, 1980, " ["94 Stat. 1811" -> "/us/stat/94/1811"] ", related to emergency powers of Secretary of Transportation. See " ["section 20104 of Title 49" -> "/us/usc/t49/s20104"] "."
